  "development_review_record": "Development review sealed for method marker-inference/2.\n\nThe only product-method change is removal of the proven coefficient-magnitude separation defect. Fresh R checks pass. The new 6000-dataset pilot is complete with unchanged scenarios and thresholds. Linear power retention is about 92.9% and 92.8% for weak and strong signals; these are development estimates, not qualification. Spline limitations and residual-test false alarms remain. HC3 F sensitivity is excluded; no cutoffs or supported-condition sets were relaxed. Confirmation uses unused seeds 2026100312/2026100313 and retains the original full 85500-dataset specification and both guarded profiles. Any failures are retained. The v1 study and manuscript package remain unchanged. No routine conditional inference is enabled before complete new confirmation and audit.\n",
  "confirmation_policy": "Freeze source hashes, protocol and independent-reference results before main/extension execution. No method/threshold/condition changes after inspection of confirmation outcomes. Any later repair requires a new version and new seeds; preserve this study."
}
